        <object id="p1_compare_coverage" label="Compare confirmed receipts&#10;with advance due" description="Compare the sum of confirmed advance receipts allocated to this declaration with the stored advance liability. The positive-amount branch guarantees that a zero receipt is unpaid, not covered." role="Tax authority / finance" system="Tax workflow (conceptual)" inputs="Advance amount due&#10;Confirmed allocated advances" outputs="Advance coverage result" added="true" kind="function" model_id="p1_compare_coverage" phase="Reconcile receipts and resolve the position" original_label="Compare confirmed receipts&#10;with advance due" tooltip="Compare confirmed receipts with advance due&#10;&#10;Compare the sum of confirmed advance receipts allocated to this declaration with the stored advance liability. The positive-amount branch guarantees that a zero receipt is unpaid, not covered.&#10;&#10;Role: Tax authority / finance&#10;&#10;Application: Tax workflow (conceptual)&#10;&#10;Inputs: Advance amount due; Confirmed allocated advances&#10;&#10;Outputs: Advance coverage result">
