  <diagram id="p1-notes" name="Notes">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1220" pageHeight="1450" math="0" shadow="0" background="#ffffff">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="notes" value="Model notes" parent="0" />
        <object id="notes-title" label="P1 | Model notes" kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="40" width="1120" height="55" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="notes-subtitle" label="Annual declaration and advance payment" kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="100" width="1120" height="40" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="notes-summary" label="An end-to-end declaration process with correction and revalidation, a recorded advance assessment, and&#10;explicit covered, partially covered and unpaid advance outcomes. Confirmed cash is recorded during&#10;reconciliation; a payment request never counts as a receipt." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="160" width="1120" height="81" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumptions-title" label="Scope and assumptions" kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="275" width="1120" height="34" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-1" label="1. The tax authority reviews advance receipts at a defined operational review point. The timing is a project&#10;   assumption, not a statutory deadline." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="325" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-2" label="2. Bank-confirmed receipts can be inspected and allocated by a human. The prototype has no live bank, DVLA,&#10;   notification or workflow integration." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="392" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-3" label="3. A valid declaration can produce zero advance due. That branch issues a no-advance confirmation without&#10;   requesting or recording a fictitious payment." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="459" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-4" label="4. For a positive advance due, covered means confirmed allocated advance receipts are at least the amount due;&#10;   partial means greater than zero but below the amount due; unpaid means no confirmed allocated advance receipt.&#10;   Any excess remains visible for final settlement." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="526" width="1120" height="75" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-5" label="5. One courteous follow-up notice and an explicit unresolved process outcome are modelled. Penalties, enforcement&#10;   and debt collection remain outside scope." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="614" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-6" label="6. The same correction loop can repeat until the declaration passes validation. If the owner has not resubmitted,&#10;   the process remains waiting at Correction requested." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="681" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-7" label="7. This is a proposed business workflow. Correction histories, payment requests, notifications and follow-up&#10;   statuses are not all persisted by the current six-table SQLite prototype." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="748" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-title" label="Using the editable diagram" kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="837" width="1120" height="34" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-0" label="• Every process shape, label, connector and satellite object is a native draw.io element." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="886" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-1" label="• The Process page has separate layers for control flow, roles / systems / data, and the title / legend." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="923" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-2" label="• Activity custom properties retain the full description, role, application, inputs and outputs from the HTML." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="960" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-3" label="• Some visible satellite labels are abbreviated to keep the diagram readable. Full values remain in the properties." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="997" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-4" label="• Blue outlines and connections identify additions or revisions compared with the repository model." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="1034" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-5" label="• This file contains the complete revised proposal from Revision 2 of the HTML. It does not change the repository." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="1071" width="1120" height="29" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>